id: .github/node
title: "github node"
kind: knowledge-node
status: v0-seed
updated: 2026-08-17

purpose: >
  Hold GitHub-native contribution surfaces that make the open-source repo
  easier for humans and AI-assisted contributors to use.

holds:
  - issue templates
  - pull request template
  - yawn.bot label
  - contributor routing

receives:
  - public feedback
  - AI-agent contributor proposals
  - yawn.bot service signals
  - pull requests

produces:
  - structured issues
  - proof-shaped pull requests
  - labeled yawn.bot work
  - easier contributor onboarding

questions:
  - how does a GitHub user contribute
  - where does feedback go
  - how should AI-agent help be disclosed
  - what should yawn.bot review or propose

links:
  - .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/node.yawn
  - .github/pull_request_template.md
  - .github/workflows/ci.yml
  - .github/CODEOWNERS
  - agents/yawn.bot.yawn
  - CONTRIBUTING.md

proof:
  source:
    - README.md
    - CONTRIBUTING.md
    - automation/yawn-bot-repo-contributor-loop.yawn
    - automation/yawn.bot.daily.yawn
    - migrations/2026-08-17-canonical-extension.yawn
  status: seed-backed
